    <string name="help_title">App Guide &amp; Help</string>
    <string name="help_overview_title">1. Overview</string>
    <string name="help_overview_text">Mihiraki PDF Utility supports 14 languages, page reordering, spread view (RTL/LTR), deleting, rotating, splitting, margin cropping, metadata/password settings, diagnostics, and local audit logs.</string>
    <string name="help_open_title">2. Opening &amp; Saving PDFs</string>
    <string name="help_open_text">Tap the Open icon (or Ctrl+O) to load a PDF. Use Save (Ctrl+S) to save all pages, or Export Selected (Ctrl+E) to save selected pages.</string>
    <string name="help_page_ops_title">3. Page Operations</string>
    <string name="help_page_ops_text">Tap pages to select them. When pages are selected, the top toolbar buttons automatically switch from general controls (Save, Add, Settings) to page editing actions (Rotate, Move, Split, Insert Blank, Delete, Export Selected).</string>
    <string name="help_display_title">4. Display Modes &amp; Devices</string>
    <string name="help_display_text">Toggle between Grid and Spread views. Use Toggle RTL to switch between Right-to-Left (RTL) and Left-to-Right (LTR) reading directions (manga/books). Optimized for smartphones, tablets, and ChromeOS.</string>
    <string name="help_settings_title">5. Settings, Diagnostics &amp; Support</string>
    <string name="help_settings_text">From the settings menu (gear icon or support heart button), you can configure and view properties, password, options, version, help, diagnostics, and support items.</string>
    <string name="help_item_overview"><b>Overview:</b> Mihiraki PDF Utility supports 14 languages, double-page spread views (RTL/LTR), and is specially optimized for scanned books and manga.</string>
    <string name="help_item_open_save"><b>Opening &amp; Saving:</b> Tap the Open icon (or Ctrl+O) to load a PDF. Use Save (Ctrl+S) to save all pages, or Export Selected (Ctrl+E) to export selected pages.</string>
    <string name="help_item_page_ops"><b>Page Operations:</b> Tap pages to select them. The top toolbar buttons dynamically adapt: unselected mode shows general actions (Save, Add, Settings), while selected mode unlocks editing tools (Rotate, Move, Split, Insert Blank, Delete, Export Selected).</string>
    <string name="help_item_display_modes"><b>Display Modes:</b> Toggle between Grid and Spread views. Supports toggling between Right-to-Left (RTL) and Left-to-Right (LTR) reading directions.</string>
    <string name="help_item_device_optimization"><b>Device Support:</b> Fully optimized for smartphones, tablets, foldable devices, and desktop (ChromeOS, etc. with keyboard shortcuts &amp; right-click).</string>
    <string name="help_item_devices"><b>Display &amp; Devices:</b> Toggle between Grid and Spread views. Supports Right-to-Left (RTL) reading mode. Fully optimized for smartphones, tablets, foldable devices, and desktop (ChromeOS, etc. with keyboard shortcuts &amp; right-click).</string>
    <string name="help_item_button_reference"><b>Toolbar Buttons Reference:</b><br/>• <b>Open / Save / Add:</b> Load PDFs, save all pages, append/merge PDFs.<br/>• <b>Selection:</b> Select all, clear, or invert selection.<br/>• <b>Page Editing:</b> Rotate, move (up/down), split, insert blank, delete, or export selected.<br/>• <b>View &amp; Settings:</b> Toggle view (grid/spread), RTL/LTR reading direction, cover layout, properties, and password security.</string>
    <string name="help_item_properties"><b>Properties &amp; Metadata:</b> Configure document title, author, subject, keywords, PDF version, and page layout.</string>
    <string name="help_item_security"><b>Security &amp; Password:</b> Set or clear encryption passwords for saving and exporting protected PDFs.</string>
    <string name="help_item_options"><b>Options &amp; Display:</b> Customize thumbnail image sizes (Small/Medium/Large) and button display types (Icon + Text / Icon Only / Text Only).</string>
    <string name="help_item_support"><b>Support Development:</b> Purchase one-time support items (Bronze, Silver, Gold) or redeem Google Play promo codes to support app development.</string>
    <string name="help_item_privacy_policy">&lt;b&gt;Privacy Policy:&lt;/b&gt; View the in-app privacy policy and data safety commitments.</string>
    <string name="help_item_diagnostics"><b>Diagnostics:</b> Run system diagnostic tests to verify PDF processor functionality, memory usage, and sample asset accessibility.</string>
    <string name="help_item_audit_logs"><b>Audit Logs:</b> Review privacy-protected local operation and runtime error audit logs (automatically retained for 24 hours, strictly excluding personal data).</string>
    <string name="help_item_report_issues"><b>Report Issues:</b> Use the "Problems Reported" screen to bulk copy diagnostic reports and app logs for easy troubleshooting and reporting via email or GitHub Issues.</string>
